{"id":"memorial_105002","cat":"memorial","group":{"id":"memorial105000","label":"Data · I Don't Just Tell Anyone.wav"},"label":"Sympathy Is Luxury.wav","stage":null,"prev":"memorial_105001","next":"memorial_105003","speakers":{},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"memorial_105002_1","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_02_description","text":"Hey, you wanna know the most dangerous thing you can do here?"},{"id":"memorial_105002_2","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_02_description","text":"Showing sympathy."},{"id":"memorial_105002_3","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_02_description","text":"Try helping 'cause you pity 'em?"},{"id":"memorial_105002_4","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_02_description","text":"You just slapped a sign on your forehead that says, \"I'm a sucker.\""},{"id":"memorial_105002_5","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_02_description","text":"And you think only the person you helped sees it that way?"},{"id":"memorial_105002_6","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_02_description","text":"Nah, everyone who saw it will think the exact same thing."},{"id":"memorial_105002_7","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_02_description","text":"We're all screwed here, so don't go pitying anyone."},{"id":"memorial_105002_8","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_02_description","text":"Got it?"}]}